[RTCT.8.1] The contract is the source of every value that
[RBND.4b] canonical RT-config serialization hashes. `.dsrt`
content + the compiler's canonicalization rules produces a
`rt_config_sha256` that:

  - is embedded in the `RealtimeContract` atom body ([RTCT.6.2] field 10);
  - is duplicated into `DscHeader.rt_config_sha256` ([RDSC.3]);
  - flows into every artifact the engine produces (fact
    stream `StreamHeader`, DAP trace `.dsr` meta) per [RBND.2];
  - is cross-checked at every load-pairing per [RBND.5].
